	(text "PMW3610 side-read trackball, its module board on the joystick mount (joystick-mount-pogo): the pogo pins\nTB_P1..6 where the mount's pads are (pin k on pad k: VCC, SDIO, SCLK, NCS, MOTION, GND), the 20 mm ball\nthrough its hole, and the sensor board (sensor/) standing on it, its header's pins down into TB_J1."
